[00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:16.200]   I, Herbert S. Sinclair, of the Mount Holly estate at Reddington, do publish and declare
[00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:25.440]   this instrument my last will and testament, and hereby revoke all wills and codicils here
